[Memory: product_context]
[Invariants]
  □ Design Truth := docs/requires (Natural Language is the source of Design Intent)
  □ Architectural Logic := Step 0 (SysML Static/Dynamic/Parametric)
  □ Formal Truth := Step 1-2 (WIT/TLA+ Canonical Specification)
  □ Implemented Truth := Step 3-4 (Codegen/Test derived from spec)
  □ ∀logic ∈ ComplexStateMachines : verified_by(logic, TLA+) (@see .agent/workflows/dev_cycle_run.md)
  □ ∀c ∈ Components : is_tier(c, 2) ⇒ matches_contract(c, harness_pattern) ∧ is_pure_static(c) (@see docs/architecture/concept_harness.md)
  □ ∀f ∈ funs(Tier2) : ¬virtual(f) ∧ ¬override(f) (@see .agent/rules/embedded_cpp_rule.md)
  □ ∀m ∈ Allocations : ¬dynamic(m) ∧ is_heap_less(m) (@see .agent/skills/embedded_cpp_check/SKILL.md §メモリ管理パターン)

[Design-Workflow: VDD]
  - Step 0 (Bonsai Design): Requirements → NL → SysML (BDD/SD/PAR). Mandatory Friction Audit.
  - Step 1-2 (Formal Verification): WIT Contract + TLA+ Invariants. Gate 2 Approval.
  - Step 3-4 (Derivation & Verification): Codegen implementation and Unit Tests derived from spec.
  - DoD Evidence Path: /inc/core/*.hxx (Generated from WIT). @source docs/backlog/wbs_tier2.md

[Design-Patterns]
  - Harness (Tier 2): composition(TemplateInjection) ∧ cost(vtable) == 0 (@see docs/architecture/concept_harness.md)
  - vMMIO-Model: ALL host-guest data exchange goes through vMMIO.
      @mechanism guest_access(addr) → permission_check(addr) → direct_physical_access(addr)
      @inv ∀access ∈ HostGuestBoundary : mediated_by(access) == vMMIO_permission_table

[Physical-Time-Model]
  - PROJECT_START := 2026-01-11
  - PHASE0_DEADLINE := 2026-03-31
  - CURRENT_PHASE := Phase 0.76 (SysML Alignment)
  - CURRENT_DATE := 2026-02-23
  - elapsed(Phase0) ≈ 43 days / 79 days total → 54% elapsed

  [Agent-Protocol: VDD Mandate]
    @inv agent_output_rate >> human_review_rate
    @inv approval_gate == rate_limiter(human_clock). Mandatory HITL Gates (Gate 0, 2, 4).
    - Step 0 Approval (Gate 0): Logic & Budget validated.
    - Test Derivation: Tests must be generated from @pre/@post, not hand-coded.
    - **Memory Discovery Protocol**: ∀task : before(start) ⇒ load(Gemini.md) ∧ load(ATC) ∧ restore(local_semantics)

[State]
  - CURRENT_DATE := 2026-02-23
  - calendar_elapsed(Phase0) ≈ 0.54
  - maturity(vSoC_workflow) ≈ 1.0 (VDD + SysML Integrated)
  - maturity(SysML_Alignment) ≈ 0.2 (Phase 0.76 Started)

  [Phase0-Gate-Criteria]
    @pre gate_pass(Phase0) requires:
      1. sysml_alignment(All_Tier2_Components) == DONE
      2. formal_verification(Critical_State_Machines) == PASS (Gate 2 approved)
      3. test_derivation_harness == READY
      4. RAM_budget_verified(Parametric_SysML) == PASS (Hypothesis <= 32KB)
    @note The design must prove its own implementation-readiness via derived tests.
